[tensorfold] warning: JPEG images need libjpeg-turbo 3.1.4.1 (libturbojpeg); the library has another release, whose pixels can differ; libturbojpeg.0.dylib is required for JPEG inputs (--vision); install libjpeg-turbo 3.1.4.1 and set TENSORFOLD_LIBTURBOJPEG to its file, or put it on the documented loader path
